OL,3,AWelsh aviation firm AerFin bought in
OL,4,A#475m deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Newport aviation company, that has
OL,7,Fgrown into a global supplier of
OL,8,Faircraft engines, parts and maintenance
OL,9,Fservices, has been bought in a deal
OL,10,Fworth about #475m.
OL,12,FJapanese firm ORIX Aviation has agreed
OL,13,Fto acquire AerFin, which employs more
OL,14,Fthan 230 people and operates from sites
OL,15,Fin the UK and around the world.
OL,17,FFounded by Bob James, AerFin has
OL,18,Fdeveloped from a south Wales business
OL,19,Finto a global aviation aftermarket
OL,20,Fspecialist.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
